WEBVTT

00:00.110 --> 00:01.490
When an owner raises their hand

00:01.490 --> 00:03.120
our team takes the first call

00:03.120 --> 00:03.730
not you

00:03.930 --> 00:05.240
We find out why they'd sell

00:05.240 --> 00:06.740
when, and what they want

00:06.740 --> 00:07.450
for the business

00:07.450 --> 00:08.400
and we screen them against

00:08.400 --> 00:09.270
your buy box

00:09.460 --> 00:10.370
If it fits

00:10.370 --> 00:11.800
we get the NDA signed and

00:11.800 --> 00:12.880
pull the financials

00:12.880 --> 00:13.620
so by the time you

00:13.620 --> 00:14.810
hear about a deal

00:14.940 --> 00:16.530
you're looking at real numbers

00:16.530 --> 00:17.470
from a real seller

00:17.470 --> 00:19.230
Before any business reaches you

00:19.480 --> 00:21.040
I take a look at it myself

00:21.040 --> 00:22.280
Every Friday you get a

00:22.280 --> 00:23.580
full pipeline report

00:23.580 --> 00:24.350
who we talked to

00:24.350 --> 00:25.810
where each owner stands

00:25.810 --> 00:27.070
and what happens next

00:27.380 --> 00:28.670
Every Monday we get

00:28.670 --> 00:29.660
on a strategy call

00:29.660 --> 00:31.020
decide what moves forward

00:31.180 --> 00:33.250
and tune the list and messaging based

00:33.250 --> 00:34.720
on what owners are telling us

00:34.720 --> 00:36.170
When you find one you like

00:36.170 --> 00:37.870
we help you get to a signed LOI

00:37.870 --> 00:39.770
from the first valuation conversation

00:39.770 --> 00:42.030
to the terms you put on paper

00:42.030 --> 00:45.030
LP First Capital had 5 qualified

00:45.030 --> 00:47.640
deals and an LOI in 60 days

00:47.790 --> 00:48.960
That's what this process

00:48.960 --> 00:49.750
is built to do
